{"id": "JAH-SIG-BOUNDEDA-000005", "slug": "tool-bounded-autonomous-operations-manager-signature", "title": "Bounded Autonomous Operations Manager \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Boundaries are the product \u2014 it never exceeds them; tasks needing broader authority are refused upfront, not mid-run. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["Permission-allowlist enforcement", "Resource-budget tracking", "Stop-condition monitoring", "Self-halt with reason records", "Full execution trace"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const budget={steps:50};let used=51;const halt=used>budget.steps;J({used,halted:halt,reason:halt?'budget exhausted':null});assert(halt,'bounded');", "verified_output": "{\"used\":51,\"halted\":true,\"reason\":\"budget exhausted\"}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Bounded Autonomous Operations Manager Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["AI Coordinator", "Workflow Engine", "Pe